# Fiery Temper has madness {R} (CR 702.35): discarded to Faithless Looting it goes to exile, and when the linked
# trigger resolves Bot1 casts it for {R}, not for {1}{R}{R}, at Bot2 (20 to 17). Two Mountains are tapped before
# Looting: Looting takes one R, madness the other, so the pool is empty right after the madness cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Fiery Temper
Faithless Looting
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Fiery Temper; Mountain)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Fiery Temper; Faithless Looting; Mountain
